Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "Scatter those Hyrulean pests! Exterminate
them!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "So that wizard's in charge, huh? I bet if we
defeat him, the monsters will leave.",
  "1.0.2.0" => "Now all I have to do is take care of that
monster!",
  "1.0.3.0" => "Why is that plant spewing poison to the
surrounding area?",
  "1.0.4.0" => "She seems to know a lot! Keep her alive!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "That's a Deku Baba. Unless you can hit it with
a sharp, ranged attack, we'll die of poisoning!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "In that case, we'd better lend a hand.",
  "1.0.7.0" => "Poisonous weed... My attacks have no effect.
We need a new strategy...",
  "1.0.8.0" => "Hey, Link, don't you usually have a bow?
Did you forget to bring one this time?",
  "1.0.9.0" => "If I remember correctly, there's a bow
located somewhere south of the village!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "That's it! Take care of the others
just like that!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "That takes care of the poison! What a relief!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "You dimwits! I won't let you run away
so easily!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "Surround the big tree...
Attack and destroy them!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Everyone's getting tired... We should retreat
to the Deku Tree for a moment!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "I'll hold off the enemies here while you
fall back!",
  "1.0.16.0" => "So they're fleeing to that stumpy little bush
there, are they? Fine! Flatten it!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "So, they chose to run and hide
in the tree, did they?",
  "1.0.18.0" => "What should we do? The enemy's heading
toward the Deku Tree!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "The Deku Tree is our base!
We have to protect it!",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Let's deal with the enemies coming from the
south before we do anything else!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "I'll help the resistance leader.",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Watch out! Enemies are threatening the
Allied Base from the north!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Looks like we took care of the southern
enemies. Let's finish off the rest of them!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "Hey! Could I get some help here?",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Excellent! Let's wreak some havoc!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "We're done for if we don't get some help...",
  "1.0.27.0" => "Don't give up! I'll be right there!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "Success! We've driven the enemy away!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "What a relief... That should give us time
to catch our breath, right?",
  "1.0.30.0" => "Enjoy your little success, weasels! My next
plan will burn your spirits to ashes! Hiya ha!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Whoa! I can see flames! A fire's been started!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "The Deku Tree is on fire! We have to quench
the flames somehow!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Hiya ha! There's no way you'll be able to put
out that fire! I'll see you burned to a crisp!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "We can't let the Deku Tree burn!
What are we supposed to do...?",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Wait a minute... I can feel the presence of
a Great Fairy! Maybe she can help us!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "Fire! Fire!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "If we don't put out the fire soon, the Deku
Tree will burn to cinders!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Yes, this is beautiful! Exterminate them!",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Dang, the doors are shut tight...
How do we open them?",
  "1.0.41.0" => "Oh, noble Great Fairy, we need your
strength! Don't leave us to this fire...",
  "1.0.42.0" => "The fires are dying out! Yeah! We can
continue fighting!",
  "1.0.43.0" => "Phew, that was a close one...
Great Fairy, we thank you!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Kah?! Who let them talk to the Great Fairy?!
That plan was PERFECT!",
  "1.0.45.0" => "So he's the one who set fire to the Deku
Tree! There's no way we'll forgive that!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "Ooh... What if I had IT kill them...?
Hiya ha ha! That's so naughty! I love it!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "No! The wizard got away!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Wha...what kind of monster is THAT?!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "That's no normal enemy! Be on guard!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "It's so powerful... But it doesn't matter!
We have to kill it somehow!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "M-monster! Somebody, help!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Oh gosh! The monster's in the Deku Tree!
Quick, use the ocarina to warp right there!",
  "1.0.55.0" => "Every monster has a weakness. We just
have to find this one's...",
  "1.0.56.0" => "What if we aim at that huge eye? I'm no expert,
but an arrow to its eye should really hurt it!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Here it comes again! And it's regenerating its
health! We've got to kill it quickly!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "It may be wisest to strike before it hides way.
If it keeps healing, we'll never end this...",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Yes! The monster has been killed!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "Amazing! We took down that huge...THING!",
  "1.0.61.0" => "Great job, everyone!
That's a solid win for us!",
  "1.0.62.0" => "The Deku Tree... We're done for!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "We couldn't save the Deku Tree...
It's hopeless...",
  "1.0.64.0" => "No... It can't be! I'm so sorry...",
  "1.0.65.0" => "This'll teach you! Hiya ha ha!",
  "1.0.66.0" => "Quickly, come to my fountain...",
  "1.0.67.0" => "I feel the Great Fairy's presence!",
  "1.0.68.0" => "I feel a powerful energy in the northeast.
Could it be the Great Fairy?",
  "1.0.69.0" => "We still haven't found the bow just yet...",
  "1.0.70.0" => "Oh, I remember! The bow was probably by
the big tree in the southwest of the village!",
  "1.0.71.0" => "Hold on! I think I remember seeing the bow by
the big tree in the southwest of the village!",
  "1.0.72.0" => "The Deku Tree will burn down if we don't do
something! We have to put out the fires, quick!",
  "1.0.73.0" => "The fire is still raging on, and now we've got
more problems to deal with?! What do we do?",
  "1.0.74.0" => "Him again... I have a feeling he's going
to be a real thorn in our sides.",
  "1.0.75.0" => "You can kill the Deku Babas with the bow
and arrows. Have you tried?",
  "1.0.76.0" => "He must know where the princess is! I'll just
have to beat the information out of him!",
  "1.0.77.0" => "Hnn...! Too fast!",
  "1.0.78.0" => "The creature got away...?",
  "1.0.79.0" => "That monster looks like it's still alive.
Why haven't we changed that yet?",
  "1.0.80.0" => "I sense the Great Fairy's power! Get rid of the
monsters in the way, and open the doors!",
  "1.0.81.0" => "The creature's coming back this way!
Get ready!",
  "1.0.82.0" => "I'll take care of the enemies coming from
the south!",
  "1.0.83.0" => "I'll handle the enemies marching from
the south.",
  "1.0.84.0" => "Once we deal with the enemies in the north,
we can focus on the ones in the south!",
  "1.0.85.0" => "We did it! We pushed the enemy back!",
  "1.0.86.0" => "Gruh... These worms are wriggling more than
I expected!",
  "1.0.87.0" => "Use this, everybody. I bet it'll come in handy!",
  "1.0.88.0" => "Now we should be able to travel back to this
statue whenever we want!",
  "1.0.89.0" => "C'mon! Let's all gather around that fiend!
If we fight together, we'll be unbeatable!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "Attacking head-on isn't working...",
  "13.0.1.0" => "If I remember correctly, I'm pretty sure there's
a bow somewhere south of the village...",
  "13.0.2.0" => "Hold on--I just remembered! There should
be a bow somewhere south of the village!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "Good! It looks like the bow still works.
What say we clean up those Deku Babas?!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "No more poison to worry about!
Thank goodness!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "We have to stop the enemy so that everyone
can fall back to the Deku Tree!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "We've got to stop the enemies coming up
from the south before we do anything else!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "She's not going to be able to do this alone...
Let's lend a hand!",
  "13.0.8.0" => "Enemies are heading for the Deku Tree!
Let's do something to stop them!",
  "13.0.9.0" => "These enemies aren't so tough! Let's wipe
them out and be done with it!",
  "13.0.10.0" => "The enemies over there don't seem like much
of a problem, but the ones over here...",
  "13.0.11.0" => "Hey! I feel a Great Fairy somewhere!
If we find her, she might be able to help!",
  "13.0.12.0" => "Hey, I feel a strong presence coming from
the northeast! It could be the Great Fairy!",
  "13.0.13.0" => "The Deku Tree is under attack from monsters.
The ocarina will help you protect it!",
  "13.0.14.0" => "Is the eye...the weak point? We should use
the bow and aim for the eye!",
  "13.0.15.0" => "The ghosts are attacking again!
And they're more powerful than ever!",
  "13.0.16.0" => "Link! Come on, pull it together!",
  "13.0.17.0" => "Phew... Looks like we beat it.
Now let's take care of the other Deku Babas!",
  "13.0.18.0" => "Enemies are heading for the Deku Tree!
Let's do something to stop them!",
  "13.0.19.0" => "If we attack from a distance, we should be
able to take it out!",
  "13.0.20.0" => "That bow should be effective against Deku
Babas. Lock on and fire some arrows off!",
}